roboparty-navigation (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging.
  * Split the runtime into roboparty-localization (FAST-LIO based
    localization, no Nav2 dependency) and roboparty-navigation (Nav2
    adapter).
  * Keep both packages on the shared install prefix (default /opt/roboparty) so
    roboparty-base/setup.bash discovers them automatically.

